# Local-only ML datasets (scripts/evaluate_*.py, scripts/finetune_*.py) and
# stray experiment checkpoints -- multiple GB, not referenced by any
# Dockerfile COPY instruction, but with no rule excluding them they still
# get walked/hashed as part of the build context (this backend service's
# context is the WHOLE repo root, not just backend/) and a *.bak checkpoint
# left inside backend/app/ml/weights/ would otherwise be copied straight
# into the image via `COPY backend ./backend`.
